Fixed E0425 by moving `use std::cmp::max;` inside `mod eisenstein_conformance` to scope for `hexdist`. Fixed E0277/E0308 by casting `self.b` to `i64` in `norm()` to avoid i64*i32. Fixed E12 by using `{z:?}` instead of `{z}` in assert messages. Module compiles with rustc --edition 2021 and all tests pass. slackwater-rust `rotate_60` returns `(a-b, a)` but correct ω-multiplication yields `(-b, a)`; does not satisfy identity (bug, counterexample: z=(1,0) gives (1,1) vs (0,1)).
